## 发展

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Build
npm run build

# Run in dev mode (Cloudflare Worker)
npm run dev

# Run locally (stdio mode)
POOF_API_KEY=your_key npm start

# Lint
npm run lint

# Format
npm run format
```

## 部署（Cloudflare Worker）

要将MCP服务器部署为Cloudflare Worker，请执行以下操作：

```bash
# Install Wrangler if you haven't already
npm install -g wrangler

# Login to Cloudflare
wrangler login

# Deploy
wrangler deploy
```

设置所需的环境机密：

```bash
wrangler secret put POOF_API_KEY
wrangler secret put MCP_JWT_SECRET
wrangler secret put COOKIE_ENCRYPTION_KEY
```

同时设置仪表板URL变量：

```bash
wrangler secret put DASHBOARD_URL
```

您还需要为OAuth状态存储创建一个KV命名空间，并更新中的ID `wrangler.toml`:

```bash
wrangler kv namespace create OAUTH_KV
wrangler kv namespace create OAUTH_KV --preview
```

